{"title":"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/b/4cb99459d8a2cfcd3a3770d2fc3d6f1c28bfe331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"33\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/f/28f3af31db9f75b43a71305c80e94f5dbc5891cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\neq b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b442f028b06d30bc44afbdbadaf91f22dc2b0dcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/2/ef2010b317802be46b6905d632331caff59d799d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{a-b}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"62\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/9/8692f0ce37dd4c4336326921b23981507ac653ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{x}{x+1}\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{x+1}{x-1}\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ x-\\frac{1}{x}\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ x+\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"389\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/7/2d795bf1288529630fdb15627e7fc91a2fba359f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{a-b}= \\frac{\\frac{a}{b} + 1}{\\frac{a}{b} - 1} = \\frac{x+1}{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"182\" height=\"44\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME\" title=\"1991 AHSME\">1991 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 